#. type: TH
#: minios-cmd.1:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "MINIOS-CMD"
msgstr "MINIOS-CMD"

#. type: TH
#: minios-cmd.1:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "MiniOS Command-Line Builder"
msgstr "Générateur en ligne de commande MiniOS"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:6
msgid "minios-cmd - configure and build a MiniOS image"
msgstr "minios-cmd - configurer et construire une image MiniOS"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:8
msgid "\\f[B]minios-cmd\\f[R] [\\f[I]OPTIONS\\f[R]]\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]minios-cmd\\f[R] [\\f[I]OPTIONS\\f[R]]\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:13
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-cmd\\f[R] is a command-line frontend for \\f[B]minios-live\\f[R]"
"(1).  It copies a configuration template or an existing configuration into a "
"work directory, applies frontend values, and runs a complete build.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-cmd\\f[R] est une interface en ligne de commande pour "
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R](1). Il copie un modèle de configuration ou une "
"configuration existante dans un répertoire de travail, applique les valeurs "
"du frontal, puis lance une construction complète.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:25
msgid ""
"The default configuration currently lists Debian \\f[B]buster\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]bullseye\\f[R], \\f[B]bookworm\\f[R], and \\f[B]trixie\\f[R]; Ubuntu "
"\\f[B]bionic\\f[R], \\f[B]focal\\f[R], \\f[B]jammy\\f[R], \\f[B]noble\\f[R], "
"and \\f[B]resolute\\f[R]; and Devuan \\f[B]beowulf\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]chimaera\\f[R], \\f[B]daedalus\\f[R], and \\f[B]excalibur\\f[R].  It "
"lists \\f[B]amd64\\f[R], \\f[B]i386\\f[R], and \\f[B]i386-pae\\f[R] "
"architectures; \\f[B]core\\f[R], \\f[B]flux\\f[R], \\f[B]xfce\\f[R], and "
"\\f[B]lxqt\\f[R] environments; \\f[B]minimum\\f[R], \\f[B]standard\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]toolbox\\f[R], and \\f[B]ultra\\f[R] variants; and \\f[B]xz\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]lzo\\f[R], \\f[B]gz\\f[R], \\f[B]lz4\\f[R], and \\f[B]zstd\\f[R] "
"compression.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"La configuration par défaut liste actuellement Debian \\f[B]buster\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]bullseye\\f[R], \\f[B]bookworm\\f[R] et \\f[B]trixie\\f[R] ; Ubuntu "
"\\f[B]bionic\\f[R], \\f[B]focal\\f[R], \\f[B]jammy\\f[R], \\f[B]noble\\f[R] "
"et \\f[B]resolute\\f[R] ; et Devuan \\f[B]beowulf\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]chimaera\\f[R], \\f[B]daedalus\\f[R] et \\f[B]excalibur\\f[R]. Elle "
"liste les architectures \\f[B]amd64\\f[R], \\f[B]i386\\f[R] et \\f[B]i386-"
"pae\\f[R] ; les environnements \\f[B]core\\f[R], \\f[B]flux\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]xfce\\f[R] et \\f[B]lxqt\\f[R] ; les variantes \\f[B]minimum\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]standard\\f[R], \\f[B]toolbox\\f[R] et \\f[B]ultra\\f[R] ; et les "
"compressions \\f[B]xz\\f[R], \\f[B]lzo\\f[R], \\f[B]gz\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]lz4\\f[R] et \\f[B]zstd\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:29
msgid ""
"Not every combination is necessarily available.  The current configuration, "
"environment links, and repositories determine what can be built."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les combinaisons ne sont pas forcément disponibles. La configuration "
"actuelle, les liens d'environnement et les dépôts déterminent ce qui peut "
"être construit."

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:37
msgid ""
"All non-help operations, including \\f[B]--config-only\\f[R], currently "
"require root.  Source-tree builds require a Debian or Ubuntu host, the "
"packages in \\f[B]linux-live/prerequisites.list\\f[R], and repository "
"access.  The default template enables apt-cacher-ng at "
"\\f[B]127.0.0.1:3142\\f[R]; run it or set \\f[B]USE_APT_CACHER=false\\f[R] "
"in the generated configuration.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Toutes les opérations autres que l'aide, y compris \\f[B]--config-"
"only\\f[R], nécessitent actuellement les droits administrateur. Les "
"constructions à partir des sources exigent un hôte Debian ou Ubuntu, les "
"paquets listés dans \\f[B]linux-live/prerequisites.list\\f[R] et un accès au "
"dépôt. Le modèle par défaut active apt-cacher-ng sur "
"\\f[B]127.0.0.1:3142\\f[R] ; exécutez-le ou définissez "
"\\f[B]USE_APT_CACHER=false\\f[R] dans la configuration générée.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: minios-cmd.1:37 condinapt.1:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPTIONS"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:40
msgid ""
"Without \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R], the distribution, architecture, desktop "
"environment, and package variant options are required.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Sans \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R], les options de distribution, d'architecture, "
"d'environnement de bureau et de variante de paquet sont obligatoires.\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: minios-cmd.1:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Options"
msgstr "Options de configuration"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]--config-file\\f[R] \\f[I]FILE\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]--config-file\\f[R] \\f[I]FILE\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:50
msgid ""
"In normal mode, copy \\f[I]FILE\\f[R] into the work directory as the base "
"configuration, then write parsed frontend values and non-empty frontend "
"defaults into that copy.  With \\f[B]--config-only\\f[R], use "
"\\f[I]FILE\\f[R] as the output path and overwrite it.  To use a "
"configuration without frontend merging, run \\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] directly "
"with \\f[B]BUILD_CONF\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"En mode normal, copie \\f[I]FILE\\f[R] dans le répertoire de travail comme "
"base de configuration, puis écrit les valeurs du frontal analysées et les "
"valeurs par défaut non vides du frontal dans cette copie. Avec \\f[B]--"
"config-only\\f[R], utilise \\f[I]FILE\\f[R] comme chemin de sortie et "
"l'écrase. Pour utiliser une configuration sans fusion du frontal, lancez "
"directement \\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] avec \\f[B]BUILD_CONF\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]--config-only\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]--config-only\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:57
msgid ""
"Generate a configuration file and do not build.  Without \\f[B]--config-"
"file\\f[R], the four required system options are required.  Supplying an "
"output path with \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R] bypasses that check, and omitted "
"target fields retain template values.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Génère un fichier de configuration sans construire. Sans \\f[B]--config-"
"file\\f[R], les quatre options système requises sont obligatoires. Fournir "
"un chemin de sortie avec \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R] contourne ce contrôle, et "
"les champs cibles omis conservent les valeurs du modèle.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-b\\f[R], \\f[B]--build-dir\\f[R] \\f[I]DIR\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-b\\f[R], \\f[B]--build-dir\\f[R] \\f[I]DIR\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:60
msgid "Use \\f[I]DIR\\f[R] as the build directory.\\fR"
msgstr "Utilise \\f[I]DIR\\f[R] comme répertoire de construction.\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: minios-cmd.1:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Options"
msgstr "Options système"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-d\\f[R], \\f[B]--distribution\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-d\\f[R], \\f[B]--distribution\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:65
msgid ""
"Set the target distribution.  Required without \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Définit la distribution cible. Obligatoire sans \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R]."
"\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-a\\f[R], \\f[B]--architecture\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-a\\f[R], \\f[B]--architecture\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:69
msgid ""
"Set the target architecture.  Required without \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Définit l'architecture cible. Obligatoire sans \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-de\\f[R], \\f[B]--desktop-environment\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-de\\f[R], \\f[B]--desktop-environment\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:73
msgid ""
"Set the desktop environment.  Required without \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Définit l'environnement de bureau. Obligatoire sans \\f[B]--config-"
"file\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-pv\\f[R], \\f[B]--package-variant\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-pv\\f[R], \\f[B]--package-variant\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:77
msgid ""
"Set the package variant.  Required without \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Définit la variante de paquet. Obligatoire sans \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R]."
"\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-c\\f[R], \\f[B]--compression-type\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-c\\f[R], \\f[B]--compression-type\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:81
msgid "Set SquashFS compression.  Default: \\f[B]zstd\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Définit la compression SquashFS. Par défaut : \\f[B]zstd\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: minios-cmd.1:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kernel Options"
msgstr "Options du noyau"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-kp\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-provider\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-kp\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-provider\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:85
msgid "Select \\f[B]distribution\\f[R] or \\f[B]minios\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Sélectionne \\f[B]distribution\\f[R] ou \\f[B]minios\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-kf\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-flavour\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-kf\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-flavour\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:89
msgid ""
"Set the kernel flavour, such as \\f[B]none\\f[R], \\f[B]rt\\f[R], or "
"\\f[B]cloud\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Définit le type de noyau, tel que \\f[B]none\\f[R], \\f[B]rt\\f[R] ou "
"\\f[B]cloud\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-mk\\f[R], \\f[B]--minios-kernel\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-mk\\f[R], \\f[B]--minios-kernel\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:92
msgid "Select the MiniOS kernel provider."
msgstr "Sélectionne le fournisseur de noyau MiniOS."

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-mks\\f[R], \\f[B]--minios-kernel-series\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-mks\\f[R], \\f[B]--minios-kernel-series\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:96
msgid ""
"Select \\f[B]auto\\f[R], \\f[B]6.1\\f[R], or \\f[B]6.12\\f[R] and use the "
"MiniOS provider.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionne \\f[B]auto\\f[R], \\f[B]6.1\\f[R] ou \\f[B]6.12\\f[R] et utilise "
"le fournisseur MiniOS.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-kpm\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-payload-mode\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-kpm\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-payload-mode\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:99
msgid "Select \\f[B]runtime\\f[R] or \\f[B]full\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Sélectionne \\f[B]runtime\\f[R] ou \\f[B]full\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-dkms\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-build-dkms\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-dkms\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-build-dkms\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:102
msgid "Build additional DKMS drivers."
msgstr "Construit des pilotes DKMS supplémentaires."

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-aufs\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-aufs\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-aufs\\f[R], \\f[B]--kernel-aufs\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:105
msgid "Deprecated alias for \\f[B]--minios-kernel\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Alias obsolète pour \\f[B]--minios-kernel\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: minios-cmd.1:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locale And Boot Options"
msgstr "Options de langue et de démarrage"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-l\\f[R], \\f[B]--locale\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-l\\f[R], \\f[B]--locale\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:110
msgid "Set the system locale.  Default: \\f[B]en_US\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Définit la locale système. Par défaut : \\f[B]en_US\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-ml\\f[R], \\f[B]--multilingual\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-ml\\f[R], \\f[B]--multilingual\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:113
msgid "Generate all locales declared by \\f[B]minioslib\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Génère toutes les locales déclarées par \\f[B]minioslib\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-kl\\f[R], \\f[B]--keep-locales\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-kl\\f[R], \\f[B]--keep-locales\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:116
msgid "Retain all available locales instead of pruning them."
msgstr "Conserve toutes les locales disponibles au lieu de les supprimer."

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-tz\\f[R], \\f[B]--timezone\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-tz\\f[R], \\f[B]--timezone\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:120
msgid "Set the timezone.  Default: \\f[B]Etc/UTC\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Définit le fuseau horaire. Par défaut : \\f[B]Etc/UTC\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-ib\\f[R], \\f[B]--initramfs-builder\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-ib\\f[R], \\f[B]--initramfs-builder\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:124
msgid ""
"Select \\f[B]livekit\\f[R] or \\f[B]dracut\\f[R].  Default: "
"\\f[B]dracut\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionne \\f[B]livekit\\f[R] ou \\f[B]dracut\\f[R]. Par défaut : "
"\\f[B]dracut\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-mln\\f[R], \\f[B]--menu-language\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-mln\\f[R], \\f[B]--menu-language\\f[R] \\f[I]NOM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:128
msgid ""
"Select \\f[B]multilang\\f[R] or a supported menu locale.  Default: "
"\\f[B]multilang\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionne \\f[B]multilang\\f[R] ou une langue de menu prise en charge. Par "
"défaut : \\f[B]multilang\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: minios-cmd.1:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ubuntu Pro Option"
msgstr "Option Ubuntu Pro"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]--ubuntu-pro-token\\f[R] \\f[I]TOKEN\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]--ubuntu-pro-token\\f[R] \\f[I]TOKEN\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:138
msgid ""
"Attach an Ubuntu Pro subscription during a Bionic, Focal, Jammy, or Noble "
"build.  Other targets skip attachment with a warning.  The builder detaches "
"the subscription and removes the token from the final image.  Command-line "
"tokens may be visible in shell history or process listings."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute un abonnement Ubuntu Pro lors d'une construction Bionic, Focal, Jammy "
"ou Noble. Les autres cibles ignorent l'attachement avec un avertissement. Le "
"constructeur détache l'abonnement et supprime le jeton de l'image finale. "
"Les jetons en ligne de commande peuvent être visibles dans l'historique du "
"shell ou dans la liste des processus."

#. type: SH
#: minios-cmd.1:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "DEFAULTS"
msgstr "VALEURS PAR DÉFAUT"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:147
msgid ""
"The frontend defaults are \\f[B]COMP_TYPE=zstd\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PROVIDER=distribution\\f[R], \\f[B]KERNEL_FLAVOUR=none\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MINIOS_KERNEL_SERIES=auto\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PAYLOAD_MODE=runtime\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_BUILD_DKMS=false\\f[R], \\f[B]LOCALE=en_US\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MULTILINGUAL=false\\f[R], \\f[B]KEEP_LOCALES=false\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]LIVE_TIMEZONE=Etc/UTC\\f[R], \\f[B]INITRAMFS_BUILDER=dracut\\f[R], and "
"\\f[B]MENU_LANG=multilang\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Les valeurs par défaut du frontal sont \\f[B]COMP_TYPE=zstd\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PROVIDER=distribution\\f[R], \\f[B]KERNEL_FLAVOUR=none\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MINIOS_KERNEL_SERIES=auto\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PAYLOAD_MODE=runtime\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_BUILD_DKMS=false\\f[R], \\f[B]LOCALE=en_US\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MULTILINGUAL=false\\f[R], \\f[B]KEEP_LOCALES=false\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]LIVE_TIMEZONE=Etc/UTC\\f[R], \\f[B]INITRAMFS_BUILDER=dracut\\f[R] et "
"\\f[B]MENU_LANG=multilang\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:155
msgid ""
"Trixie-based \\f[B]i386\\f[R] and \\f[B]i386-pae\\f[R] values select the "
"MiniOS provider when the distribution and architecture are supplied to the "
"frontend through options or the environment.  Values present only inside "
"\\f[B]--config-file\\f[R] are not loaded before defaults are calculated.  "
"Frontend defaults may differ from values in the full \\f[B]build.conf\\f[R] "
"template.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Les valeurs \\f[B]i386\\f[R] et \\f[B]i386-pae\\f[R] basées sur Trixie "
"sélectionnent le fournisseur MiniOS lorsque la distribution et "
"l'architecture sont fournies au frontal via les options ou l'environnement. "
"Les valeurs présentes uniquement dans \\f[B]--config-file\\f[R] ne sont pas "
"chargées avant le calcul des valeurs par défaut. Les valeurs par défaut du "
"frontal peuvent différer de celles du modèle complet \\f[B]build.conf\\f[R]."
"\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:157
msgid "Build a standard Bookworm Xfce image with frontend defaults:"
msgstr ""
"Construire une image Bookworm Xfce standard avec les valeurs par défaut du "
"frontal :"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:163
msgid "Build with a MiniOS kernel, DKMS drivers, and retained locales:"
msgstr ""
"Construire avec un noyau MiniOS, des pilotes DKMS et conservation des "
"locales :"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv toolbox -mk -dkms -kl\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv toolbox -mk -dkms -kl\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:169
msgid "Build a multilingual image:"
msgstr "Construire une image multilingue :"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:172
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d trixie -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard -ml\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d trixie -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard -ml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:175
msgid "Build the Flux minimum variant with livekit:"
msgstr "Construire la variante minimale Flux avec livekit :"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:178
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de flux -pv minimum -ib livekit\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de flux -pv minimum -ib livekit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:181
msgid "Generate or overwrite a configuration file:"
msgstr "Générer ou écraser un fichier de configuration :"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:185
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo minios-cmd --config-only --config-file ./myconfig.conf \\[rs]\n"
"  -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo minios-cmd --config-only --config-file ./myconfig.conf \\[rs]\n"
"  -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:188
msgid "Use the file without frontend merging:"
msgstr "Utiliser le fichier sans fusion côté frontal :"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo BUILD_CONF=/absolute/path/myconfig.conf minios-live -\n"
msgstr "sudo BUILD_CONF=/absolute/path/myconfig.conf minios-live -\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:195
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt-"
"minios\\f[R](7)\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt-"
"minios\\f[R](7)\\fR"
